{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Disclaimer: All characters involved in sexual activity are 18 years of age or older and all sexual activity is consensual; you must be of legal age to play Doll Labo].</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main character is a futanari</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are on duty as a security guard at Doll Labo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But something strange is happening\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the unfinished Dolls, which should never move, have begun to wander through the facility\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Do not let them find you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive until the designated time and complete your duties.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Dolls are being researched and developed to help and support people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, they are currently only test prototypes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They may try to tempt you with alluring behavior,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >but you must not give in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999730/extras/eb295722dbd0424c8679b6ac150bedab.avif?t=1762568452\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What happens if you get caught?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999730/extras/2639d66da9b40c09b17a573dc7db35b2.poster.avif?t=1762568452\" width=800 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999730/extras/2639d66da9b40c09b17a573dc7db35b2.webm?t=1762568452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999730/extras/2639d66da9b40c09b17a573dc7db35b2.mp4